This product includes software originally developed as part of the Yona
project (https://github.com/yona-projects/yona), itself continued from the
Yobi project. yona is a from-scratch re-implementation of Yona's application
layer on a different technology stack (Kotlin/Spring Boot/JPA instead of
Java/Scala/Play Framework/Ebean); no source code was copied from the
original Play/Ebean codebase, but yona reproduces its data model, views, and
behavior, and is therefore a derivative work for licensing purposes. See
LICENSE for the Apache License, Version 2.0 under which both projects are
distributed, and AUTHORS for attribution carried forward from the original
project.

